<Base>
  <h1>Freek Byrman</h1>
  <p>
    I work on machine learning that uses the geometry and symmetry of a problem as inductive
    bias, especially in the sciences, where that structure is known from first principles.
    I hold MSc degrees in Artificial Intelligence (Universiteit van Amsterdam) and
    Econometrics and Operations Research (Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam).
  </p>
  <p>
    This site collects my academic research and the things I build outside of it.
  </p>

